    "Question #: 2": {
      "Title": "Exam MB-340 topic 1 question 2 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Your role of Systems Administrator includes the management of your company's Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance system."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You need to configure posting definitions and posting profiles. You need to determine under which circumstance you should configure a posting definition or a posting profile."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which two of the following statements are true? (Choose two)."
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. You should use posting definitions when you need to support encumbrance accounting for purchase orders and pre-encumbrance accounting for purchase requisitions."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. You should use posting profiles when you need to support encumbrance accounting for purchase orders and pre-encumbrance accounting for purchase requisitions."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. You should use posting definitions when you need to generate multiple, balanced ledger entries based on attributes such as transaction types and accounts."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. You should use posting definitions when you need only one offset ledger entry."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: AC \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Reference:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamicsax-2012/appuser-itpro/about-posting-definitions"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
